00:03:30.300 --> 00:03:32.801
♪ Oh, no, no, no ♪

00:03:32.801 --> 00:03:35.667
♪ Oh, no, no, n-o-o-o ♪

00:03:35.667 --> 00:03:40.300
♪ And I don't know
if I'm ever comin' home ♪

00:03:40.300 --> 00:03:43.534
-Micky Dolenz right there,
ladies and gentlemen!

